      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "According to the criterion, either DeltaUMin or DeltaUMax is set e.g MinSizeCrtierion sets DeltaUMin when MaxSizeCriterion sets DeltaUMax.\nThe implicit rule is that DeltaUMin is predominant over DeltaUMax i.e.:\nUpdateWithUMaxValue:\nDeltaUMax = Max(DeltaUMin, Min(DeltaUMax, NewDeltaUMax))\nUpdateWithUMinValue:\nDeltaUMin = Max(DeltaUMin, NewDeltaUMin)\nDeltaUMax = Max(DeltaUMax, NewDeltaUMin)"
